{"ID":"20230927165123-c60x5nl","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927165123-c60x5nl","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165123-c60x5nl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165126-ikh7isi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165126-00dtz7y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927165126-00dtz7y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:11,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:11\u0026#125;","title":"远志","type":"doc","updated":"20230927165126"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927165126-ikh7isi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165126-ikh7isi","updated":"20230927165126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"远志的根很大丛，可是露出地面的草只有一点点，〔形而上〕好像人的志气，灵魂在另外一个世界可能活很久，偶而到地球上出生为人。「远志」的苖称为「小草」，因为它的苗只有一点点，所以它凝聚气的力量很强，像小炮台一样，把肾脏的气像打水枪一样打得很高。「远志」被用来嘲笑人说「在家为远志，出外为小草（指远志苗）」。"}]},{"ID":"20230927165126-00dtz7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927165126-00dtz7y","updated":"20230927165126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"远志，把肾气上提向心。"}]}]}